:"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov","html_url":"https://github.com/dslomov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dslomov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/milestones/5","html_url":"https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/milestone/5","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/milestones/5/labels","id":1717213,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTcxNzIxMw==","number":5,"title":"0.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"damienmg","id":3721087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjEwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3721087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg","html_url":"https://github.com/damienmg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/damienmg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":158,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-04-19T15:07:50Z","updated_at":"2020-05-12T11:10:23Z","due_on":"2017-06-30T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2017-11-29T19:06:44Z"},"comments":5,"created_at":"2016-07-08T15:17:10Z","updated_at":"2019-02-04T19:01:00Z","closed_at":"2017-03-29T17:33:09Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Specifying that a provider named one of a list of undocumented reserved names (at least \"files\", \"runfiles\",  be mandatory always fails to resolve:\n\nmandatory_provider_rule.bzl:\n\n```\ndef _mandatory_provider_impl(ctx):\n    return struct(files=set(ctx.files.deps))\n\nmandatory_provider_rule = rule(\n  _mandatory_provider_impl,\n  attrs={\n      \"deps\": attr.label_list(providers=[\"files\"])\n  }\n)\n```\n\nBUILD:\n\n```\nload(\":mandatory_provider_rule.bzl\", \"mandatory_provider_rule\")\n\nmandatory_provider_rule(name=\"a\")\nmandatory_provider_rule(name=\"b\", deps=[\":a\"])\n```\n\nObviously runfiles, files, instrumented_files, and some other overloaded reserved-name provider are being treated differently here.  Using a value of a type that is anything other than each keyword expects, e.g. int for \"files\", results in a differentiated error related to type mismatch, implying implicit typing/usage/interpretation.  I would expect that there are several possible resolutions here:\n1. Pass through reserved-name providers to be observable by dependent targets in RuleContext::validateRuleDependency\n2. Document the reserved names, and fail on providers=[...] specification containing reserved names that cannot not be resolved with a helpful error message\n3. Use a different mechanism for transferring these reserved-name providers than the return of a struct impl - something mutable/assignable in ctx.\n","closed_by":{"login":"bazel-io","id":15028808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MDI4ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15028808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io","html_url":"https://github.com/bazel-io","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bazel-io/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/1490/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}